
CDict Timers

( timers implemented in C, not physical )

: .set (id -- )             0 sys.timer ;     (store "now" for timer)
: .get (id -- millis)       1 sys.timer ;     (get millis 0-32k or 0x7FFF if overflow)
: .getLong (id -- millis>L) 2 sys.timer ;     (get millis as long value)
: .getSec (id -- seconds)   3 sys.timer ;     (get seconds 0-32k, 0x7FFF if overflow)
: .div (factor id -- count rest) 4 sys.timer ;  (return millis as two values capped at 0x7FFF)

CDictEnd
